    <div class="about__copy" data-rv="right">
      <p class="eyebrow">About ProTac</p>
      <h2>A security program built for your site, with leadership you can reach.</h2>
      <p class="about__story">We're a Santa Maria company. A vineyard at 2 a.m. and a gated neighborhood at shift change don't have the same problems, so we don't hand them the same plan. Tell us what worries you about your site and we'll start there.</p>
