<section class="cmp-s sec" id="compare">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="sec__head" data-rv="clip">
      <p class="eyebrow">Know the difference</p>
      <h2>Posted officer or mobile patrol?</h2>
    </header>
    <div class="cmp" id="cmp" data-rv="up">
      <table>
        <thead><tr><td></td><th scope="col"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg>Posted officer</th><th scope="col"><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-car"/></svg>Mobile patrol</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr data-x="A posted officer is yours for the shift. A patrol officer has other stops on the route.">
            <th scope="row"><button type="button">Who's on site</button></th>
            <td data-h="Posted officer">An officer stays for the whole shift</td><td data-h="Mobile patrol">An officer comes by, then moves on</td></tr>
          <tr data-x="If something could go wrong at any moment, you want someone there. If you mostly need the site checked, patrol can do it.">
            <th scope="row"><button type="button">Best for</button></th>
            <td data-h="Posted officer">Sites that need a person there the whole time</td><td data-h="Mobile patrol">Sites that need checking, but not all shift</td></tr>
          <tr data-x="Patrol covers the times the officer is there. Between visits, nobody is on the property.">
            <th scope="row"><button type="button">How often property is checked</button></th>
            <td data-h="Posted officer">Throughout the shift</td><td data-h="Mobile patrol">At each visit</td></tr>
          <tr data-x="An officer on site can act right away. A patrol officer has to get there first.">
            <th scope="row"><button type="button">Response to a problem</button></th>
            <td data-h="Posted officer">The officer is already there</td><td data-h="Mobile patrol">The officer has to drive over</td></tr>
          <tr data-x="Plenty of sites use both, like a posted officer at the gate and patrol for the far corners. Ask us what makes sense for yours.">
            <th scope="row"><button type="button">Typical sites</button></th>
            <td data-h="Posted officer">Gates, lobbies, active job sites, events</td><td data-h="Mobile patrol">Closed yards, farms, spread-out properties</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
      <p class="cmp__x" id="cmp-x" aria-live="polite">Hover or tap a row for the plain version.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

